@prefix backlog: <http://example.org/backlog#> .
@prefix ex:      <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage#> .
@prefix owl:     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs:    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .

<http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Urgent narrow lineage: SEN0414 chapters 10 and 11, one code, one environment"@en ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.33.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage/1.33.0> ; dcterms:identifier "sen0414_ch1011simp_lineage" ;
    rdfs:comment """1.33.0 (2026-11-24): Scope change only (one stage per version). The Owner ruled at 14:09 Istanbul that results may span several lines, that Windows is the default platform, and that no story may repeat (drop it or find an alternative). Discipline files were last re-read from GitHub on 2026-11-24 (OE 2.41.0, lineage discipline 163.0.7)."""@en .

ex:CR11_RepeatsWindows a backlog:ChangeRequest ;
    rdfs:label "Remove repeated stories, show Windows as the default platform, allow multi-line results"@en ;
    backlog:requestsChangeTo ex:Scope11 ; backlog:hasChangeDirection backlog:Direction_Grow ;
    backlog:hasChangeRequestRationale "Owner's ruling of 2026-11-24 14:09 Istanbul (content, not a verbatim quotation): there is no one-line result rule; programs may return multi-line outputs when needed. The default platform is Windows. A story must not repeat; either drop repeating stories or find alternatives." ;
    backlog:hasDisposition backlog:Disp_Accepted .

ex:IA11_RepeatsWindows a backlog:ImpactAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "What repeats and what is Linux-flavoured today, measured before planning"@en ;
    backlog:analyzesRequest ex:CR11_RepeatsWindows ; backlog:identifiesAffectedLineage ex:Lineage11 ;
    backlog:hasImpactStatement "MEASURED FACTS (2026-11-24, read-only, story repeat check over chapters 1 to 25): chapter 10 has 4 stories, two repeat: the UTF-8 diner story has the same link and the same two names as chapter 8; the JSON story shares both people with chapter 7. The dbm story shares only a person's name with chapters 8 and 9 (different events). Chapter 11 has 4 stories and none repeats. Results: the page already accepts multi-line outputs (test 9.40.0); only the one-line prediction field is limiting. Platform: recorded outputs show Linux path types today. Cost named: replace 2 chapter 10 stories in place (slide count unchanged), new deck, source, page versions and tests for chapter 10; Windows presentation touches both chapters." ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Open: how Windows is shown (one Owner question to follow). Separate gap noted, not in this change: the ruling against everyday analogies is not yet applied to chapters 10 and 11." .

ex:Area11_Repeats a backlog:ScopeArea ; rdfs:label "No repeated stories, Windows default, multi-line results"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage11 .
ex:Del11_Repeats_10 a backlog:ScopeDeliverable ; rdfs:label "Chapter 10 deck and page without repeated stories"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage11 ; backlog:deliverableForArea ex:Area11_Repeats .
ex:Del11_Windows a backlog:ScopeDeliverable ; rdfs:label "Chapters 10 and 11 with Windows as the default platform"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage11 ; backlog:deliverableForArea ex:Area11_Repeats .

ex:SC11_RepeatsWindows a backlog:ScopeChange ;
    rdfs:label "Scope grown by story de-duplication, Windows default and multi-line results"@en ;
    backlog:fulfillsRequest ex:CR11_RepeatsWindows ; backlog:changesScope ex:Scope11 ; backlog:decidedBy backlog:Owner ;
    backlog:admitsItem ex:Area11_Repeats, ex:Del11_Repeats_10, ex:Del11_Windows ;
    backlog:hasScopeChangeRationale "Owner's ruling of 2026-11-24 14:09 Istanbul. One area and two deliverables added; other chapters stay excluded. The urgency case is resolved only after these are done." .
ex:Scope11 backlog:coversArea ex:Area11_Repeats ; backlog:hasScopeDeliverable ex:Del11_Repeats_10, ex:Del11_Windows .
